00:04:01.270 --> 00:04:02.103
What do y'all do?

00:04:02.103 --> 00:04:02.936
Y'all like karaoke?

00:04:02.936 --> 00:04:03.769
You, well you do it.

00:04:03.769 --> 00:04:04.620
