you, Mamoudou, what do you do?

00:04:28.390 --> 00:04:29.223
- Twist and shout.

00:04:29.223 --> 00:04:30.600
I also don't drink by the way.

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.433
Twist and Shout.

00:04:31.433 --> 00:04:32.604
- [Kelly] You don't drink either?

00:04:32.604 --> 00:04:33.437
- Ah.

00:04:33.437 --> 00:04:34.590
Okay. You don't have to drink.

